# Leave these commented out for local development: the app will
# automatically call the backend on whatever host you loaded this page
# from (e.g. localhost on your laptop, or your LAN IP on a phone), on
# port 5000. This is what makes the app work correctly on a phone
# without any manual configuration.
#
# Only set these explicitly if your backend runs on a different port,
# a different host entirely, or behind a reverse proxy in production.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:5000
